{"id":"3bc949095b085182","group":"88","path":"88/88-thm-ls-upward.md","title":"Upward Löwenheim-Skolem","display":"thm-ls-upward — Upward Löwenheim-Skolem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-thm-ls-upward","aliases":["88-thm-ls-upward"],"display":"thm-ls-upward — Upward Löwenheim-Skolem","depends_on":["[[88-df-language]]","[[88-df-signature-size]]","[[88-df-structure]]","[[88-df-elementary-substructure]]","[[88-df-cardinality]]","[[88-thm-compactness]]","[[88-thm-lowenheim-skolem]]","[[88-df-satisfaction]]","[[88-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-thm-ls-upward"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-thm-ls-upward</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ls-upward — Upward Löwenheim-Skolem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"da378af7f2f57e43\" href=\"?note=da378af7f2f57e43\" title=\"88-df-signature-size\">88-df-signature-size</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3a560d130315ebdc\" href=\"?note=3a560d130315ebdc\" title=\"88-df-structure\">88-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2b85c726d5a8ee87\" href=\"?note=2b85c726d5a8ee87\" title=\"88-df-elementary-substructure\">88-df-elementary-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3fb55f9cf4d73400\" href=\"?note=3fb55f9cf4d73400\" title=\"88-df-cardinality\">88-df-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e66fa0a2ff4a679f\" href=\"?note=e66fa0a2ff4a679f\" title=\"88-thm-compactness\">88-thm-compactness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4df32d0a7ee8d3b6\" href=\"?note=4df32d0a7ee8d3b6\" title=\"88-thm-lowenheim-skolem\">88-thm-lowenheim-skolem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7d0aefc635fe57fc\" href=\"?note=7d0aefc635fe57fc\" title=\"88-df-satisfaction\">88-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Language}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{card}_{\\mathrm{sig}}(S)\">\\(\\operatorname{card}_{\\mathrm{sig}}(S)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"da378af7f2f57e43\" href=\"?note=da378af7f2f57e43\" title=\"88-df-signature-size\">88-df-signature-size</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> 为候选无限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"3a560d130315ebdc\" href=\"?note=3a560d130315ebdc\" title=\"88-df-structure\">88-df-structure</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\\)</span> 与基数比较见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"3fb55f9cf4d73400\" href=\"?note=3fb55f9cf4d73400\" title=\"88-df-cardinality\">88-df-cardinality</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_S\">\\(\\preceq_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"2b85c726d5a8ee87\" href=\"?note=2b85c726d5a8ee87\" title=\"88-df-elementary-substructure\">88-df-elementary-substructure</a>。</li>\n<li>带参数公式与满足关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"7d0aefc635fe57fc\" href=\"?note=7d0aefc635fe57fc\" title=\"88-df-satisfaction\">88-df-satisfaction</a>；证明使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"e66fa0a2ff4a679f\" href=\"?note=e66fa0a2ff4a679f\" title=\"88-thm-compactness\">88-thm-compactness</a> 和 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"4df32d0a7ee8d3b6\" href=\"?note=4df32d0a7ee8d3b6\" title=\"88-thm-lowenheim-skolem\">88-thm-lowenheim-skolem</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ls\\text{-}upward}\\vdash\n\\forall S,\\mathfrak A,\\kappa\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\aleph_0\\leq|\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)|\n\\land\\max\\{|\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)|,\n\\operatorname{card}_{\\mathrm{sig}}(S),\\aleph_0\\}\\leq\\kappa\\bigr)\n\\to\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B)\\land\\mathfrak A\\preceq_S\\mathfrak B\n\\land|\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak B)|=\\kappa\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ls\\text{-}upward}\\vdash\n\\forall S,\\mathfrak A,\\kappa\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\aleph_0\\leq|\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)|\n\\land\\max\\{|\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)|,\n\\operatorname{card}_{\\mathrm{sig}}(S),\\aleph_0\\}\\leq\\kappa\\bigr)\n\\to\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B)\\land\\mathfrak A\\preceq_S\\mathfrak B\n\\land|\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak B)|=\\kappa\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明。添加命名原结构每个元素的常量，并加入它们满足的全部带参数公式，即完全初等图；再添加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 个新常量及它们两两不等的句子。任意有限部分只要求有限多个不同元素，原结构无限保证可满足。紧致性给出该扩张理论的模型，其中原结构有一个初等嵌入，且论域至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>扩张语言大小至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>。应用向下定理，在此模型中取包含全部已命名元素、大小恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 的初等子结构；忘去新增常量后得到所需大小的初等扩张。最后沿初等嵌入搬运结构，将原结构的副本识别回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span>，因此结论可以是字面上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\preceq_S\\mathfrak B\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\preceq_S\\mathfrak B\\)</span>，而不只是“存在一个同构副本”。</p>\n<p>基数条件已显式要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\\)</span>，语言大小改为全部非逻辑符号的基数，避免对编码元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 取基数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"99f4e6abf02e07ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-signature-size","status":"resolved","id":"da378af7f2f57e43","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-signature-size]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3a560d130315ebdc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"2b85c726d5a8ee87","anchor":"ref-4","